## 🚀 Overview

A **production-ready backend system** built using **Node.js & Express**, designed to handle authentication, media uploads, and structured music management.

Built with a focus on:
- scalability ⚡  
- clean architecture 🧠  
- real-world backend practices 🏗️  

---

## ⚙️ Tech Stack


Node.js • Express • MongoDB • Mongoose • JWT • Multer


---

## 🔥 Features

✨ Secure JWT Authentication (Cookie-based)  
👤 Role-based Access Control (Artist / User)  
🎧 Upload & Manage Music Files  
💿 Album Creation & Linking  
☁️ Cloud Storage via Service Layer  
⚡ Clean MVC Architecture  

---

## 🔄 System Flow


Client → Routes → Middleware → Controller → Database → Response


---

## 🔐 Authentication Flow


Register/Login → JWT Token → Stored in Cookies → Middleware Verification → Protected APIs


---

## 📡 API Endpoints


POST /api/auth/register
POST /api/music/upload
POST /api/music/album
GET /api/music
GET /api/music/albums


---

## ⚡ Quick Start

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ARPITPRAJAPATI/music_app_backend.git
cd music_app_backend
npm install
npm run dev
🔑 Environment Variables
MONGO_URI=your_mongo_uri
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
PORT=3000
🧠 Architecture Mindset

This project follows a layered backend design:

Routes → handle API endpoints
Middleware → handle auth & security
Controllers → business logic
Services → external integrations
Models → database schema


